# --- Two traps found while diagnosing, both worth knowing --------------------

# `env` in oasis_events does NOT distinguish staging from prod:
#   emitLiveSessionEvent sets  env: isDevSandbox() ? 'dev-sandbox' : 'production'
#   so STAGING events also report env=production. Use build-info git_commit.

# nova_voice telemetry never lands (0 of 90 session.start events in 24h) —
# VTID-03704 added it to routes/orb-live.ts:16518, but the emit that fires is
# live-session-controller.ts:2001. I had used its ABSENCE as evidence that
# VTID-03704 was not deployed. That inference was wrong:
git merge-base --is-ancestor b8b54b06 fed50c93 && echo "03704 IS in prod"
#   -> 03704 IS in prod. Filed as task #35.

